{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "00fb5b0f-755a-4756-a1a6-330bc56bdeb1",
    "name": "Bridge API v2 (Auth & Profil)",
    "description": "Postman Collection untuk Bridge API v2 — mencakup semua endpoint API v2 (auth, profil, berita, pesan, akademik, presensi, input nilai, pembayaran, email kampus, e-admisi, admin).\n\n**Auth:** Gunakan `auth:sanctum` dengan Bearer token.\n\n**Variable:**\n- `{{base_url}}` — base URL (contoh: `https://bridge.ecampuz.com`)\n- `{{token}}` — Bearer token setelah login\n- `{{token_admisi}}` — Bearer token khusus dengan ability `eadmisi-access-token`\n- `{{semester}}` — kode semester (e.g. `20251`)\n- `{{teman_id}}` — username tujuan pesan\n- `{{pesan_id}}` — ID pesan\n- `{{kelas_id}}` — ID kelas\n- `{{pertemuan_id}}` — ID pertemuan/presensi\n- `{{nim}}` — NIM mahasiswa\n- `{{nip}}` — NIP dosen\n- `{{username}}` — username portal\n- `{{prodi_kode}}` — kode prodi\n- `{{nomor_pendaftaran}}` — nomor pendaftaran PMB",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58270602",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/58270602-00fb5b0f-755a-4756-a1a6-330bc56bdeb1?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = jsonData.data?.token || jsonData.token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                  "    console.log('Token berhasil disimpan:', token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "210101001",
                  "description": "NIM/NIP/NIK portal"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "password123",
                  "description": "Password portal"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v2/portal/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "portal",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v2/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "logout"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
